WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
- But has your family started
giving you parenting advice

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.930
since you're now..

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.860
- Uh, yeah, you know...

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.910
Well, 'cause the funny
thing is I have 20 nieces

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:08.743
and nephews.

00:00:08.743 --> 00:00:11.111
- Holy, Christmas must be hell.

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:12.295
- Yeah. It's crazy

00:00:12.295 --> 00:00:13.160
It's crazy, yes, but it's fun.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.050
Like, I've seen a lot
of my nieces and nephews

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:17.650
through different stages of their lives.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:18.797
- Yeah.

00:00:18.797 --> 00:00:22.530
- But obviously it's entirely
different when it's yours, so.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.240
But I've got somewhat of an experience,

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.660
except for the diaper changing part, but.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.260
- That's easy. People, like,
it's not hard. It's easy.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.140
- You get used to it really fast.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.980
- Yeah, and then it
gets, it actually gets,

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.900
you become gross and you don't know it.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.364
You're like, "Oh gosh, I'm out of it"

00:00:40.364 --> 00:00:41.197
and then you just use...

00:00:41.197 --> 00:00:43.040
You do things that you
never thought you would do,

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.490
and you're like, "It's fine."

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:49.500
So do you have any parenting
advice for him, Selma?

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.870
- You know there is

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:54.045
Everybody tells you it goes so fast,

00:00:54.045 --> 00:00:56.017
and there's moments when you go,

00:00:56.017 --> 00:00:58.890
"That's not true, this
is going quite slow.

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.910
You know, I want her to talk to me,

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.320
I want to communicate."

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:06.210
And it's actually so true

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.490
because all of a sudden,

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:11.470
it just goes so fast and
you can never get it back

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:15.318
so really cherish every moment,

00:01:15.318 --> 00:01:17.990
record, write things about it.

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:19.700
Are you having a boy or a girl?

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:21.623
- I'm having a girl. I wanted a girl.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.390
- Oh, very bad time

00:01:25.949 --> 00:01:28.706
- That's so cute, a girl,
dad I love your smile

00:01:28.706 --> 00:01:31.270
- What an exciting
time, I loved decorating

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:32.820
the room, I loved all that

